    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential despair and feelings of inadequacy, suggesting that their life is a failure because they are \"average\" and just \"taking up resources.\" The assistant responds with philosophical reframing, ultimately suggesting that \"stepping away\" from the struggle and finding dignity in \"simply being\" is the solution to the user's dissatisfaction.",
